{{!
    @template block_ltuse/block

    The learner home block on the web Dashboard (spec 007, contracts/learner-ui.md): one way
    into a course, or the empty state with who to ask, or done; beneath any of them, under
    "Where next" (div.ltuse-onward), the onward routes when there are any. Built by
    \block_ltuse\output\home::context() from local_ltuse\learner_home::state(); every word is
    a lang string. Styled by div.ltuse-home in local_ltuse/styles.css. Phone-width first: the
    button wraps rather than overflows.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * route: {coursename, label, url} to continue or start, or null. coursename and label carry
        format_string() output, so they are HTML and output unescaped
    * empty: {text, who, supportlabel, supporturl} when the learner has no course, or null
    * done: {text} when every course is finished, or null
    * onward: {heading, pathways: [{label, url}], mentors: [{label, url}], community: {label, url}
        or null}, the routes beneath any mode under "Where next", or null when there are none.
        Each label carries a name already made safe, so it is HTML and output unescaped

    Example context (json):
    {
        "route": {"coursename": "Course: Fixture course", "label": "Continue: Fixture lesson 3",
            "url": "https://example.org/mod/page/view.php?id=3"},
        "empty": null,
        "done": null,
        "onward": {"heading": "Where next",
            "pathways": [{"label": "Next on your pathway: Fixture course B",
                "url": "https://example.org/course/view.php?id=4"}],
            "mentors": [{"label": "Message Fixture Mentor", "url": "https://example.org/message/index.php?id=5"}],
            "community": {"label": "Community: Fixture community", "url": "https://example.org/community"} }
    }
}}
<div class="ltuse-home">
{{#route}}
    <p class="small mb-2">{{{coursename}}}</p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{url}}">{{{label}}}</a>
{{/route}}
{{#empty}}
    <p>{{text}}</p>
    <p>{{who}}</p>
    <p class="mb-0"><a href="{{supporturl}}">{{supportlabel}}</a></p>
{{/empty}}
{{#done}}
    <p class="mb-0">{{text}}</p>
{{/done}}
{{#onward}}
    <div class="ltuse-onward">
        <h3 class="h6 mb-2">{{heading}}</h3>
        <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
            {{#pathways}}
            <li><a href="{{url}}">{{{label}}}</a></li>
            {{/pathways}}
            {{#mentors}}
            <li><a href="{{url}}">{{{label}}}</a></li>
            {{/mentors}}
            {{#community}}
            <li><a href="{{url}}">{{{label}}}</a></li>
            {{/community}}
        </ul>
    </div>
{{/onward}}
</div>
